            "review_title": "Review at Lucia Phú Quốc",
            "review_text": "Gelana S\n31 contributions\n0\nGood\nJan 2025 • Friends\nThe interior of the restaurant is beautiful, the cuisine is good as well, the atmosphere is nice. \nThey even have hookah. \nThe service is better than in other restaurants in the promenade street. \n\nThere is only one minus is the show!\nYou need to pay for your stay if you are there at 19:45, however we ordered the food which was provided only at 19:27, and they ask you to finish your meal before the show and go away or pay.\nRead more\nWritten January 17, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
