            "review_title": "Review at Lucia Phú Quốc",
            "review_text": "junebiswas\nBangkok, Thailand409 contributions\n1\nBreathtaking setting, great food\nAug 2023 • Couples\nThis is a beautiful Mediterranean style eatery that serves brilliant food and equally fantastic cocktails as you watch the ocean in the gorgeous sunset town.\n\nWe loved the cold cut and cheese platter and their unique selection of cocktails out of which my favorite was the Mamnhigirta made of sandalwood tequila, chilli vodka, sandalwood syrup, lime, sweet and sour and Phu Quoc fish sauce. In main couse, the Iberico steak was outstanding and full of flavor. I also loved the baked fish and creamy prawn linguine.\n\nAnd a special thanks to Hong for ensuring that we had a great time at Lucia eatery and mixology, Phú Quốc\nRead more\nWritten August 28, 2023",
